      "comment": "SUNSET CLARICE (1) goes very well this trip starting 36 times for 15 wins and 12 minors. In the money last time at Mandurah (27.27) in a Free For All, finishing a long neck third. Makes strong appeal on best. CLEM FANDANGO (2) hit the frame latest (30.42) when third at this track in a Novice race. Looks suited here and can measure up. REX HAVOC (6) is a smart dog yet to miss the frame, last start scoring at this track (29.98), making it two straight wins. Performs well off this draw. Will go close here with a clear run. WEST ON ROGUE (5) will need to run right up to last start to feature again.",
